P[#P+1]={"^\\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Master%s+Zul'Gurub%s+on%s+Mythic%s+Difficulty!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>Mythic%s+Zul'Gurub%s+offers%s+the%s+ultimate%s+challenge%s+with%s+top%-tier%s+rewards%.<br/><br/>\\r\nDefeat%s+Hakkar%s+to%s+earn%s+prestigious%s+Mythic%s+Loot%s+exclusive%s+to%s+this%s+difficulty!</p>%s*$","\\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">以史诗难度征服祖尔格拉布！</h{{2}}><br/>\\r\n<p>史诗祖尔格拉布提供终极挑战与顶尖奖励。<br/><br/>\\r\n击败哈卡即可获得此难度专属的珍贵史诗战利品！</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\InPersonInvasion:2:1}\\r\n<p>An%s+invasion%s+is%s+a%s+periodic%s+World%s+Event%s+that%s+spawns%s+throughout%s+Azeroth%s+and%s+scales%s+to%s+how%s+many%s+players%s+are%s+near%s+the%s+zone%.</p>\\r\n\\r\n<p>To%s+find%s+an%s+invasion,%s+you%s+can%s+look%s+on%s+your%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|hWorld%s+Map|h|r%s+or%s+ask%s+in%s+World%s+Chat%s+if%s+one%s+is%s+currently%s+up%.</p>\\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\Worldmaplegioninvasion:2:1}\\r\n<p>To%s+complete%s+an%s+invasion,%s+you%s+must%s+kill%s+the%s+Final%s+Boss%.%s+Once%s+entering%s+an%s+invasion,%s+a%s+percentage%s+completion%s+counter%s+will%s+appear%.%s+Once%s+this%s+counter%s+reaches%s+(.-)%%%s+the%s+final%s+boss%s+will%s+appear%.</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\InPersonInvasion:2:1}\\r\n<p>入侵是一种周期性世界事件，会在整个艾泽拉斯出现，并依据区域内附近玩家的数量调整强度。</p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>要找到入侵，你可以查看你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r，或在世界频道中询问当前是否有入侵开启。</p>\\r\\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\Worldmaplegioninvasion:2:1}\\r\\n<p>要完成入侵，你必须击杀最终首领。进入入侵后会出现一个进度百分比计数器。当该计数器达到 {{1}}% 时，最终首领会现身。</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\Level70:2:1}\\r\n<p>Continue%s+your%s+journey%s+in%s+Outlands%s+and%s+acquire%s+enough%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r%s+to%s+reach%s+level%s+(.-)%.</p>\\r\n\\r\n<p>As%s+you%s+continue%s+advancing%s+in%s+levels%s+you%s+will%s+have%s+to%s+travel%s+to%s+new%s+zones%s+to%s+find%s+quests%s+and%s+creatures%s+closer%s+to%s+your%s+level%s+to%s+continue%s+gaining%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r%.</p>\\r\n\\r\n<p>Hit%s+M,%s+then%s+right%s+click%s+the%s+map%.%s+This%s+will%s+zoom%s+you%s+out%s+to%s+the%s+overall%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|hWorld%s+Map|h|r%.%s+Mouseover%s+the%s+areas%s+around%s+your%s+current%s+zone%.%s+You%s+will%s+see%s+the%s+zone's%s+level%s+range%s+in%s+the%s+top%s+center%s+of%s+the%s+map%.</p>\\r\n\\r\n<p>Find%s+a%s+zone%s+that%s+matches%s+your%s+level%s+and%s+travel%s+there%s+to%s+discover%s+new%s+quests%s+and%s+continue%s+your%s+journey%s+to%s+level%s+(.-)%.</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\Level70:2:1}\\r\n<p>继续你在外域的旅程，获取足够的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验|h|r 以达到 {{1}} 级。</p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>随着你继续升级，你需要前往新的区域，寻找与你等级更相符的任务和生物，以继续获取 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验|h|r。</p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>按 M 键，然后右键点击地图。这会拉远视角以显示完整的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r。将鼠标移到你当前区域周围的地区上，你会在该地图顶部中央看到区域等级范围。</p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>寻找一个与你等级相符的区域并前往那里，以发现新任务并继续你的旅程直到 {{2}} 级。</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\101_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Reach%s+Level%s+(.-)!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>Continue%s+traveling%s+to%s+new%s+zones%s+to%s+find%s+new%s+quests%s+and%s+more%s+challenging%s+creatures%s+to%s+continue%s+gaining%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r%.<br/><br/>\\r\nCheck%s+the%s+Path%s+to%s+Ascension%s+menu%s+often%s+for%s+new%s+quests%s+as%s+you%s+level%s+up!%s+Completing%s+Paths%s+to%s+Ascension%s+will%s+grant%s+you%s+rewards%s+as%s+well%s+as%s+ensure%s+you%s+reach%s+the%s+heights%s+of%s+your%s+power%s+while%s+exploring%s+the%s+world%s+and%s+gaining%s+levels!</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\101_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">达到 {{2}} 级！</h{{3}}><br/>\\r\\n<p>继续前往新的区域，寻找新的任务和更具挑战性的生物，以继续获取 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验|h|r。<br/><br/>\\r\\n随着你升级，请经常查看飞升之路菜单以寻找新任务！完成飞升之路会给予你奖励，并确保你在探索世界和升级的过程中达到力量的顶峰！</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\105_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Your%s+Tamed%s+Beast%s+has%s+Pet%s+Talents!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>You've%s+gained%s+your%s+first%s+Pet%s+Talent%s+Point!%s+These%s+are%s+earned%s+every%s+(.-)%s+levels%s+starting%s+at%s+level%s+(.-)%.<br/><br/>\\r\nRight%-click%s+your%s+Pet's%s+Portrait,%s+Select%s+Pet%s+Talents,%s+then%s+click%s+any%s+talent%s+to%s+learn%s+it!</p>\\r\n{page}\\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\105_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Empower%s+Your%s+Tamed%s+Beast%s+with%s+Pet%s+Talents!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>Each%s+Tamed%s+Beast%s+type%s+has%s+a%s+different%s+Pet%s+Talent%s+tree!%s+Only%s+Tamed%s+Beasts%s+have%s+Pet%s+Talents%.<br/><br/>\\r\nThe%s+Beast%s+Mastery%s+talent%s+located%s+in%s+the%s+Beast%s+Mastery%s+Talent%s+Tree%s+grants%s+an%s+additional%s+(.-)%s+Pet%s+Talent%s+Points%.</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\105_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">你的驯养野兽拥有宠物天赋！</h{{2}}><br/>\\r\\n<p>你获得了第一个宠物天赋点！从 {{4}} 级开始，每 {{3}} 级可获得一个宠物天赋点。<br/><br/>\\r\\n右键点击你的宠物头像，选择宠物天赋，然后点击任意天赋进行学习！</p>\\r\\n{page}\\r\\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\105_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{5}} align=\"center\">用宠物天赋强化你的驯养野兽！</h{{6}}><br/>\\r\\n<p>每种驯养野兽都有不同的宠物天赋树！只有驯养野兽才拥有宠物天赋。<br/><br/>\\r\\n位于野兽控制天赋树中的野兽控制天赋会额外给予 {{7}} 个宠物天赋点。</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\18_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Heroic%s+Raiding%s+%-%s+Heroic%s+Loot!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>Heroic%s+Raids%s+drop%s+Heroic%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r%s+Gear!%s+This%s+is%s+the%s+same%s+loot%s+that%s+drops%s+from%s+Normal%s+Raids,%s+but%s+stronger!<br/><br/>\\r\nHeroic%s+Raids%s+build%s+on%s+everything%s+you%s+learned%s+in%s+Normal%s+Raids%.%s+Boss%s+mechanics%s+deal%s+more%s+damage,%s+and%s+ignoring%s+them%s+will%s+almost%s+always%s+lead%s+to%s+death!<br/><br/>\\r\nIt's%s+helpful%s+to%s+have%s+maxed%s+PvE%s+Power%s+and%s+Mystic%s+Enchants%s+that%s+compliment%s+your%s+build%.</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\18_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">英雄团队副本 - 英雄战利品！</h{{2}}><br/>\\r\n<p>英雄团队副本会掉落英雄 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 装备！它与普通团队副本掉落的战利品相同，但更加强力！<br/><br/>\\r\n英雄团队副本建立在你在普通团队副本中学到的一切之上。首领机制的伤害更高，忽视它们几乎总会导致死亡！<br/><br/>\\r\n将 PvE 力量升满，并搭配与你的专精互补的神秘附魔会很有帮助。</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\220_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Defeat%s+level%s+(.-)%s+and%s+you%s+can%s+begin%s+your%s+next%s+run%s+at%s+level%s+(.-)!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>Unlock%s+Checkpoints%s+every%s+(.-)th%s+level,%s+allowing%s+you%s+to%s+start%s+a%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r%s+from%s+that%s+level%.<br/><br/>\\r\nYou%s+will%s+encounter%s+specific%s+Checkpoint%s+fights%s+as%s+you%s+progress!%s+Defeating%s+these%s+Checkpoints%s+unlocks%s+new%s+creatures,%s+new%s+levels,%s+new%s+bosses%s+and%s+more%s+powerful%s+loot!</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\220_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">击败 {{2}} 级后，你就可以从 {{3}} 级开始下一轮挑战！</h{{4}}><br/>\\r\n<p>每 {{5}} 级解锁一个检查点，让你可以从该等级开始一场 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r。<br/><br/>\\r\\n随着你的推进，你会遇到特定的检查点战斗。击败这些检查点会解锁新的生物、新的等级、新的首领和更强大的战利品！</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\225_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Buy%s+the%s+|cffe6cc80|Hitem:339041|h%[Interrupt%s+Rod%]|h|r%s+from%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h|r!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>Bosses%s+often%s+have%s+powerful%s+spells%s+and%s+abilities%s+that%s+deal%s+massive%s+amounts%s+of%s+damage%.%s+The%s+Interrupt%s+Rod%s+will%s+allow%s+you%s+to%s+counter%s+enemy%s+spell%s+casts%.<br/><br/>\\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm%s+Spells|h|r%s+and%s+Upgrades%s+are%s+added%s+to%s+your%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity%s+Collection|h|r,%s+meaning%s+all%s+of%s+your%s+characters%s+on%s+this%s+realm%s+will%s+gain%s+access%s+to%s+the%s+Interrupt%s+Rod!<br/><br/>\\r\nThe%s+|cffe6cc80|Hitem:339041|h%[Interrupt%s+Rod%]|h|r%s+Spell%s+can%s+be%s+found%s+inside%s+the%s+Ascension%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r%s+Items%s+tab%s+in%s+your%s+spell%s+book!</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\225_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|h考格斯沃斯|h|r 处购买 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:339041|h[打断法杖]|h|r！</h{{2}}><br/>\\r\n<p>首领通常拥有造成大量伤害的强大法术和技能。打断法杖可以让你反制敌人的施法。<br/><br/>\\r\\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|h法力风暴法术|h|r 和升级会加入你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r，这意味着你在此服务器的所有角色都能使用打断法杖！<br/><br/>\\r\\|cffe6cc80|Hitem:339041|h[打断法杖]|h|r 的法术可在法术书中的飞升 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 物品标签页中找到！</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\229_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Heal%s+with%s+your%s+|cffe6cc80|Hitem:254041|h%[Endless%s+Manastorm%s+Potion%]|h|r!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>You%s+automatically%s+receive%s+an%s+|cffe6cc80|Hitem:254041|h%[Endless%s+Manastorm%s+Potion%]|h|r%s+in%s+your%s+inventory%s+each%s+time%s+you%s+enter%s+the%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r%.<br/><br/>\\r\nThis%s+potion%s+has%s+unlimited%s+uses%s+and%s+will%s+allow%s+you%s+to%s+progress%s+through%s+Manastorms%s+solo%s+or%s+with%s+friends%s+when%s+you%s+do%s+not%s+have%s+a%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:237|hTank|h|r%s+or%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|hHealer|h|r%.<br/><br/>\\r\nDrag%s+the%s+|cffe6cc80|Hitem:254041|h%[Endless%s+Manastorm%s+Potion%]|h|r%s+onto%s+your%s+bar%s+and%s+use%s+it%s+to%s+heal%s+anytime%s+your%s+health%s+gets%s+low!</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\229_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">用你的 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254041|h[无尽法力风暴药水]|h|r 治疗自己！</h{{2}}><br/>\\r\n<p>每次进入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 时，你都会自动在背包中获得一瓶 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254041|h[无尽法力风暴药水]|h|r。<br/><br/>\\r\\n这种药水使用次数无限，当你没有 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:237|h坦克|h|r 或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|h治疗者|h|r 时，它可以让你独自或与朋友一起在法力风暴中推进。<br/><br/>\\r\\|cffe6cc80|Hitem:254041|h[无尽法力风暴药水]|h|r 拖到你的动作条上，生命值低时随时使用它治疗自己！</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\230_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Use%s+Your%s+|cffe6cc80|Hitem:254042|h%[Milhouse's%s+Magical%s+Escape%]|h|r!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>You%s+will%s+automatically%s+receive%s+|cffe6cc80|Hitem:254042|h%[Milhouse's%s+Magical%s+Escape%]|h|r%s+in%s+your%s+inventory%s+each%s+time%s+you%s+enter%s+the%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r%.<br/><br/>\\r\nThis%s+potion%s+will%s+allow%s+you%s+to%s+break%s+free%s+from%s+stuns,%s+silences,%s+and%s+other%s+loss%s+of%s+control%s+effects%s+that%s+could%s+quickly%s+lead%s+to%s+your%s+death!<br/><br/>\\r\nThis%s+item%s+has%s+unlimited%s+uses%s+and%s+is%s+key%s+to%s+your%s+survival%.%s+Drag%s+|cffe6cc80|Hitem:254042|h%[Milhouse's%s+Magical%s+Escape%]|h|r%s+onto%s+your%s+hot%s+bar%s+and%s+use%s+it%s+to%s+escape%s+deadly%s+crowd%s+control%s+effects%.</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\230_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">使用你的 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254042|h[米尔豪斯的魔法逃脱]|h|r！</h{{2}}><br/>\\r\n<p>每次进入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 时，你都会自动在背包中获得 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254042|h[米尔豪斯的魔法逃脱]|h|r。<br/><br/>\\r\n这种药水可以让你摆脱昏迷、沉默以及其他可能迅速导致死亡的控制效果！<br/><br/>\\r\n该物品使用次数无限，是你生存的关键。把 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254042|h[米尔豪斯的魔法逃脱]|h|r 拖到你的动作条上，用它摆脱致命的范围控制效果。</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\231_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Slot%s+(.-)%s+Active%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm%s+Spells|h|r!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>Your%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r%s+Active%s+Spell%s+loadout%s+can%s+complement%s+your%s+build!%s+There%s+is%s+no%s+best%s+setup,%s+only%s+the%s+setup%s+that%s+matches%s+your%s+build%s+and%s+playstyle%.<br/><br/>\\r\nFind%s+a%s+set%s+of%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm%s+Spells|h|r%s+that%s+complement%s+your%s+build%s+and%s+fill%s+out%s+all%s+(.-)%s+slots!</p>\\r\n{page}\\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\231_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Cogsley%s+sells%s+new%s+spells%s+and%s+upgrades!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>Cogsley%s+sells%s+many%s+tools%s+that%s+increase%s+your%s+power%s+and%s+offer%s+new%s+utility%s+to%s+allow%s+you%s+to%s+progress%s+further%s+into%s+the%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r%.<br/><br/>\\r\nOnce%s+you%s+find%s+a%s+set%s+of%s+spells%s+that%s+work%s+well%s+for%s+you,%s+try%s+to%s+upgrade%s+them%s+as%s+much%s+as%s+possible!</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\231_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">第 {{2}} 个栏位已激活 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|h法力风暴法术|h|r！</h{{3}}><br/>\\r\n<p>你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 主动法术配置可以与你的构筑互补！没有最优配置，只有最适合你的构筑和玩法的那一套。<br/><br/>\\r\n寻找一组能与你的构筑互补的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|h法力风暴法术|h|r，并填满全部 {{4}} 个栏位！</p>\\r\n{page}\\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\231_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{5}} align=\"center\">考格斯利出售新的法术和升级！</h{{6}}><br/>\\r\n<p>考格斯利出售许多能提升你实力并提供新功能的工具，让你能在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 中走得更远。<br/><br/>\\r\n一旦你找到一套适合你的法术组合，就尽量把它们全部升级！</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\247_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">You%s+Can%s+Save%s+Your%s+Transmogs%s+with%s+Outfits!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>Once%s+you’ve%s+made%s+a%s+complete%s+transmog,%s+you%s+can%s+save%s+it%s+with%s+the%s+Outfits%s+tab%s+in%s+the%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h|r!%s+This%s+way%s+if%s+you%s+change%s+your%s+look,%s+you%s+can%s+apply%s+your%s+previously%s+saved%s+Outfit%s+with%s+ease%s+and%s+not%s+have%s+to%s+remake%s+your%s+transmog%s+from%s+scratch%.<br/><br/>\\r\nYou%s+can%s+have%s+as%s+many%s+different%s+Outfits%s+as%s+you%s+like,%s+there%s+is%s+no%s+limit!<br/><br/>\\r\nYour%s+Outfit%s+collection%s+is%s+saved%s+to%s+your%s+server,%s+so%s+all%s+of%s+your%s+different%s+characters%s+can%s+apply%s+your%s+various%s+transmogs%s+with%s+just%s+the%s+click%s+of%s+a%s+button!</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\247_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">你可以用套装保存你的幻化！</h{{2}}><br/>\\r\n<p>完成一套完整的幻化后，你可以用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r 中的套装标签页将其保存下来！这样，即使你改变了外观，也能轻松应用之前保存的套装，而不必从头重做幻化。<br/><br/>\\r\n你可以拥有任意数量的不同套装，没有上限！<br/><br/>\\r\n你的套装收藏会保存在服务器上，所以你所有的不同角色都能一键应用你的各种幻化！</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\64_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Visit%s+the%s+Mark%s+of%s+Triumph%s+Vendor!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>Marks%s+of%s+Triumph%s+are%s+earned%s+by%s+completing%s+Heroic%s+and%s+Mythic%s+difficulty%s+dungeons%.<br/><br/>\\r\nThese%s+marks%s+can%s+be%s+exchanged%s+for%s+gear!%s+Use%s+them%s+to%s+upgrade%s+your%s+gear%s+or%s+save%s+up%s+for%s+specific%s+equipment%s+key%s+to%s+your%s+build%.<br/><br/>\\r\nVisit%s+Markus%s+in%s+the%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|hStormwind|h|r%s+Throne%s+Room%s+to%s+see%s+the%s+gear%s+you%s+can%s+acquire%.</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\64_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">拜访凯旋徽记商人！</h{{2}}><br/>\\r\n<p>凯旋徽记通过完成英雄和史诗难度的地下城获得。<br/><br/>\\r\n这些徽记可以兑换装备！用它们升级你的装备，或攒起来购买对你构筑至关重要的特定装备。<br/><br/>\\r\n拜访暴风城 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|h王座厅|h|r 的马库斯，查看你可以获取的装备。</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\80_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<p>Continue%s+your%s+journey%s+and%s+acquire%s+enough%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r%s+to%s+reach%s+level%s+(.-)%.<br/><br/>\\r\nAs%s+you%s+continue%s+advancing%s+in%s+levels,%s+you%s+will%s+have%s+to%s+travel%s+to%s+new%s+zones%s+to%s+find%s+more%s+challenging%s+creatures%s+and%s+quests!</p>\\r\n{page}\\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\reachlevel152:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Use%s+the%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|hWorld%s+Map|h|r%s+to%s+find%s+new%s+zones!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>Hit%s+M,%s+then%s+right%-click%s+the%s+map%.%s+This%s+will%s+zoom%s+you%s+out%s+to%s+the%s+overall%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|hWorld%s+Map|h|r%.%s+Mouseover%s+the%s+areas%s+around%s+your%s+current%s+zone%.%s+You%s+will%s+see%s+the%s+zone's%s+level%s+range%s+in%s+the%s+top%s+center%s+of%s+the%s+map%.<br/><br/>\\r\nFind%s+the%s+nearby%s+zone%s+that%s+is%s+level%s+(.-)%+%s+and%s+travel%s+there%s+to%s+discover%s+new%s+quests%s+and%s+continue%s+your%s+journey%s+to%s+level%s+(.-)%.</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\80_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<p>继续你的旅程，获取足够的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验|h|r 以达到 {{1}} 级。<br/><br/>\\r\n随着你继续升级，你需要前往新的区域，寻找更具挑战性的生物和任务！</p>\\r\n{page}\\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\reachlevel152:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{2}} align=\"center\">使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r 寻找新的区域！</h{{3}}><br/>\\r\n<p>按 M 键，然后右键点击地图。这会把视角拉远到完整的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r。将鼠标移到你当前区域周围的地区上，你会在该地图顶部中央看到区域等级范围。<br/><br/>\\r\n寻找附近 {{4}} 级以上的区域并前往那里，以发现新任务并继续你的旅程直到 {{5}} 级。</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\81_1:2:1}\\r\n<p>You%s+can%s+find%s+a%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall%s+Board|h|r%s+in%s+any%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital%s+City|h|r!</p>\\r\n\\r\n<p>You%s+can%s+use%s+these%s+boards%s+while%s+leveling%s+to%s+discover%s+where%s+to%s+go%s+next%s+and%s+accept%s+any%s+tutorial%s+quests%s+you%s+may%s+have%s+missed%.</p>\\r\n\\r\n<p>At%s+max%s+level,%s+the%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall%s+Board|h|r%s+offers%s+Daily%s+Quests%s+and%s+Weekly%s+Quests%s+granting%s+you%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|hCall%s+Board%s+Caches|h|r,%s+Marks%s+of%s+Ascension,%s+Mystic%s+Orbs,%s+and%s+Mystic%s+Runes%.</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\81_1:2:1}\\r\n<p>你可以在任何 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 中找到 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r！</p>\\r\n\\r\n<p>升级过程中你可以使用这些告示板来了解下一步该去哪里，并接取任何你可能错过的教学任务。</p>\\r\n\\r\n<p>在满级时，|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 会提供每日任务和每周任务，给予你 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r、飞升徽记、神秘法球和神秘符文。</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\84_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Continue%s+your%s+journey%s+and%s+reach%s+level%s+(.-)!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>Continue%s+to%s+accept%s+and%s+complete%s+new%s+quests,%s+venturing%s+into%s+more%s+difficult%s+areas%s+as%s+you%s+gain%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r%s+until%s+you%s+reach%s+level%s+(.-)!</p>\\r\n{page}\\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\reachlevel202:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Quests%s+Unlock%s+as%s+Your%s+Level!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:199|hQuest%s+Givers|h|r%s+with%s+a%s+Grey%s+Exclamation%s+Mark%s+means%s+you%s+must%s+be%s+a%s+higher%s+level%s+to%s+accept%s+their%s+quest%.<br/><br/>\\r\nAs%s+you%s+gain%s+levels,%s+more%s+difficult%s+quests%s+will%s+become%s+available%s+to%s+you%.<br/><br/>\\r\nQuests%s+in%s+the%s+starter%s+area%s+scale%s+up%s+to%s+level%s+(.-)!%s+All%s+other%s+quests%s+scale%s+up%s+to%s+max%.%s+That%s+means%s+you%s+will%s+never%s+out%-level%s+the%s+quests%s+you%s+are%s+on%s+or%s+quest%s+hubs!</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\84_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">继续你的旅程并达到 {{2}} 级！</h{{3}}><br/>\\r\n<p>继续接取并完成新任务，在获取 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验|h|r 的过程中深入更艰难的地区，直到达到 {{4}} 级！</p>\\r\n{page}\\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\reachlevel202:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{5}} align=\"center\">任务会随你的等级解锁！</h{{6}}><br/>\\r\n<p>带有灰色感叹号的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:199|h任务发布者|h|r 表示你必须达到更高的等级才能接取其任务。<br/><br/>\\r\n随着你升级，更困难的任务会向你开放。<br/><br/>\\r\n起始区域的任务会随等级提升至 {{7}} 级！其他所有任务都会提升至满级。这意味着你永远不会超过你所在任务或任务枢纽的等级！</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\91_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Increase%s+your%s+Mounted%s+Speed!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>Talk%s+to%s+a%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|hRiding%s+Trainer|h|r%s+to%s+learn%s+Apprentice%s+Riding!%s+This%s+will%s+increase%s+your%s+mounted%s+movement%s+speed%s+from%s+(.-)%%%s+to%s+(.-)%%!<br/><br/>\\r\nYou%s+can%s+find%s+Traveling%s+Riding%s+Trainers%s+in%s+early%s+level%s+quest%s+hubs%s+or%s+visit%s+your%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital%s+City|h|r%s+and%s+ask%s+a%s+guard%s+for%s+directions%s+to%s+the%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|hRiding%s+Trainer|h|r%.</p><br/><br/>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\91_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">提高你的坐骑速度！</h{{2}}><br/>\\r\n<p>与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 交谈以学习学徒骑术！这会把你的坐骑移动速度从 {{3}}% 提高到 {{4}}%！<br/><br/>\\r\n你可以在低等级任务枢纽找到旅行骑术训练师，或前往你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 向卫兵询问 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 的方向。</p><br/><br/>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\93_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Learned%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r%s+are%s+stored%s+in%s+your%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:186|hPets%s+Tab|h|r</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>•Open%s+up%s+your%s+Character%s+Sheet%s+%(Hotkey%s+C%)%.<br/>\\r\n•Click%s+the%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:186|hPets%s+Tab|h|r%s+on%s+the%s+bottom%.<br/>\\r\n•Click%s+the%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r%s+tab%s+on%s+the%s+top%.<br/></p>\\r\n{page}\\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\93_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Drag%s+your%s+Mount%s+onto%s+your%s+Hot%s+Bars!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>This%s+gives%s+you%s+quick%s+access%s+to%s+summon%s+your%s+mount%s+with%s+a%s+key%s+of%s+your%s+choosing%.<br/><br/>\\r\nYour%s+first%s+mount%s+increases%s+your%s+movement%s+speed%s+by%s+(.-)%%%.<br/><br/>No%s+Riding%s+Training%s+is%s+required%.%s+You%s+can%s+learn%s+to%s+ride%s+even%s+faster%s+at%s+a%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|hRiding%s+Trainer|h|r%.</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\93_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">已学习的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r 会保存在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:186|h宠物标签页|h|r 中</h{{2}}><br/>\\r\n<p>•打开你的角色信息面板（快捷键 C）。<br/>\\r\n•点击下方的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:186|h宠物标签页|h|r。<br/>\\r\n•点击上方的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r 标签页。<br/></p>\\r\n{page}\\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\93_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{3}} align=\"center\">把你的坐骑拖到动作条上！</h{{4}}><br/>\\r\n<p>这样你就可以用自己选择的按键快速召唤坐骑。<br/><br/>\\r\n你的第一个坐骑会使你的移动速度提高 {{5}}%。<br/><br/>不需要骑术训练。你可以通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 更快地学会骑乘。</p>"}
