P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Dungeon_Finder_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Complete%s+a%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>Open%s+the%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|hDungeon%s+Finder|h|r%s+and%s+queue%s+for%s+a%s+Random%s+Normal%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r%s+or%s+pick%s+any%s+of%s+the%s+available%s+Specific%s+Dungeons%.<br/><br/>\\r\nNormal%s+Difficulty%s+Dungeons%s+are%s+entry%s+level%s+end%-game%s+content%s+that%s+will%s+help%s+you%s+learn%s+your%s+build%s+and%s+gear%s+up!</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Dungeon_Finder_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">完成一个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r！</h{{2}}><br/>\\r\n<p>打开 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r，排队进入随机普通 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r，或选择任何可用的指定地下城。<br/><br/>\\r\n普通难度地下城是入门级的终局内容，会帮助你熟悉自己的构筑并提升装备！</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Epic_Riding_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Ride%s+at%s+(.-)%%%s+Mounted%s+Movement%s+Speed!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>Talk%s+to%s+a%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|hRiding%s+Trainer|h|r%s+to%s+learn%s+Journeyman%s+Riding!%s+This%s+will%s+increase%s+your%s+mounted%s+movement%s+speed%s+from%s+(.-)%%%s+to%s+(.-)%%!<br/><br/>\\r\nVisit%s+your%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital%s+City|h|r%s+and%s+ask%s+a%s+guard%s+for%s+directions%s+to%s+the%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|hRiding%s+Trainer|h|r%.<br/><br/>\\r\nYou%s+can%s+often%s+acquire%s+a%s+|cffe6cc80|Hitem:3001005|h%[Riding%s+Tome:%s+Journeyman%s+Riding%]|h|r%s+from%s+the%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction%s+House|h|r%s+or%s+another%s+player%s+cheaper%s+than%s+the%s+Trainer%s+offers!</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Epic_Riding_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">以 {{2}}% 的移动速度骑乘！</h{{3}}><br/>\\r\n<p>与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 交谈以学习老练骑术！这会把你的坐骑移动速度从 {{4}}% 提高到 {{5}}%！<br/><br/>\\r\n前往你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r，向卫兵询问 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 的方向。<br/><br/>\\r\n你常常可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 或从其他玩家处以比训练师更低的价格购得 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:3001005|h[骑术宝典：老练骑术]|h|r！</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\First_Class_Teleporter_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Fast%s+Travel%s+to%s+High%-Level%s+Zones%s+and%s+Capital%s+Cities!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>The%s+First%s+Class%s+Experimental%s+Teleporter%s+allows%s+you%s+to%s+air%s+drop%s+between%s+Capital%s+Cities%s+and%s+into%s+high%-level%s+zones%.<br/><br/>\\r\nThis%s+Teleporter%s+is%s+located%s+in%s+popular%s+parts%s+of%s+the%s+Capital%s+Cities,%s+it%s+stands%s+out%s+and%s+you%s+won't%s+miss%s+it%.</p>\\r\n{page}\\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\First_Class_Teleporter_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Steer%s+your%s+Parachute!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>You%s+will%s+be%s+dropped%s+hundreds%s+of%s+yards%s+into%s+the%s+air,%s+don't%s+worry,%s+we%s+provide%s+a%s+parachute%s+that%s+lasts%s+just%s+long%s+enough%s+to%s+get%s+you%s+to%s+the%s+ground%.%.%.%s+safely!<br/><br/>\\r\nYou%s+can%s+turn%s+your%s+camera%s+to%s+steer%s+the%s+direction%s+of%s+your%s+parachute%.%s+Operator%s+takes%s+full%s+responsibility%s+for%s+their%s+steering!</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\First_Class_Teleporter_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">快速前往高等级区域和主城！</h{{2}}><br/>\\r\n<p>头等实验传送器让你可以在主城之间以及前往高等级区域进行空投。<br/><br/>\\r\n该传送器位于主城的热闹区域，十分显眼，你不会错过它的位置。</p>\\r\\n{page}\\r\\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\First_Class_Teleporter_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\\n<h{{3}} align=\"center\">操控你的降落伞！</h{{4}}><br/>\\r\\n<p>你将被投放到数百码的高空，别担心，我们提供的降落伞刚好够把你安全地送到地面！<br/><br/>\\r\\n你可以转动镜头来操控降落伞的方向。操控员对其方向承担全部责任！</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Titan_Scrolls_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Buff%s+the%s+whole%s+realm!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:239|hTitan%s+Scrolls|h|r%s+grant%s+a%s+unique%s+buff%s+to%s+every%s+hero%s+in%s+the%s+open%s+world%s+based%s+on%s+the%s+titan%s+they%s+resemble%.%s+Multiple%s+scrolls%s+can%s+be%s+used%s+to%s+stack%s+each%s+buff%s+to%s+(.-)%s+and%s+refresh%s+their%s+duration%.<br/><br/>\\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:239|hTitan%s+Scrolls|h|r%s+announce%s+who%s+used%s+them%s+in%s+Global%s+Chat,%s+letting%s+other%s+heroes%s+know%s+who%s+to%s+thank!</p>\\r\n{page}\\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Titan_Scrolls_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<p>There%s+are%s+(.-)%s+difference%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:239|hTitan%s+Scrolls|h|r:<br/>\\r\n•%s+Norgannon<br/>\\r\n•%s+Eonar<br/>\\r\n•%s+Aggramar<br/>\\r\n•%s+Khaz'goroth<br/>\\r\n•%s+Golganneth<br/><br/>\\r\nYou%s+can%s+obtain%s+them%s+from%s+the%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction%s+House|h|r%s+or%s+randomly%s+when%s+slaying%s+creatures%.</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Titan_Scrolls_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">强化整个服务器！</h{{2}}><br/>\\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:239|h泰坦卷轴|h|r 会根据其代表的泰坦，为开放世界中的每位英雄提供一种独特的增益。可以多次使用卷轴将每种增益叠加至 {{3}} 层并刷新其持续时间。<br/><br/>\\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:239|h泰坦卷轴|h|r 会在综合频道中公布使用者，让其他英雄知道该感谢谁！</p>\\r\n{page}\\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Titan_Scrolls_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<p>共有 {{4}} 种不同的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:239|h泰坦卷轴|h|r：<br/>\\r\n• 诺甘农<br/>\\r\n• 艾欧娜尔<br/>\\r\n• 阿格拉玛<br/>\\r\n• 卡兹格罗斯<br/>\\r\n• 高戈奈斯<br/><br/>\\r\n你可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 获得它们，或在击杀生物时随机掉落。</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Vanity_Items_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Customize%s+your%s+Appearance%s+with%s+Vanity%s+Items!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>Cosmetic%s+Vanity%s+items%s+help%s+you%s+create%s+your%s+unique%s+look%s+tailored%s+to%s+your%s+class%s+fantasy%.<br/><br/>\\r\nYou%s+can%s+find%s+a%s+huge%s+selection%s+on%s+the%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction%s+House|h|r!%s+Click%s+the%s+Rarity%s+Dropdown%s+and%s+select%s+Vanity%.%s+Then%s+hit%s+Search!<br/><br/>\\r\nYou%s+can%s+Ctrl%s+%+%s+Left%s+Click%s+an%s+item%s+to%s+preview%s+its%s+appearance%.%s+Find%s+and%s+Buyout%s+any%s+Vanity%s+item%s+on%s+the%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction%s+House|h|r%.</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Vanity_Items_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">用外观物品自定义你的造型！</h{{2}}><br/>\\r\n<p>外观物品可以帮助你打造契合职业幻想的独特造型。<br/><br/>\\r\n你可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 找到海量选择！点击品质下拉菜单并选择外观，然后点击搜索！<br/><br/>\\r\n你可以按住 Ctrl 并左键点击物品来预览其外观。在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 中寻找并购买任意外观物品。</p>"}
