P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\honorvendoralliance:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Visit%s+the%s+Honor%s+Gear%s+Vendor!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>Visit%s+John%s+\"Sailor\"%s+Honor%s+in%s+Champion's%s+Hall,%s+Old%s+Town%s+in%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|hStormwind|h|r%.<br/><br/>\\r\nHis%s+location%s+is%s+marked%s+on%s+the%s+map%s+with%s+the%s+Honor%s+and%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r%s+Quartermaster%s+POI%.</p>\\r\n{page}\\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Honor%s+Gear%s+Boosts%s+your%s+PvP%s+Power!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>This%s+NPC%s+trades%s+PvP%s+Gear%s+for%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|hHonor%s+Points|h|r!<br/><br/>\\r\nYou%s+can%s+purchase%s+a%s+full%s+set%s+of%s+Season%s+(.-)%s+gear%s+after%s+a%s+few%s+Battlegrounds!%s+This%s+gear%s+will%s+massively%s+increase%s+your%s+survivability%s+and%s+damage%s+in%s+Battlegrounds%.<br/><br/>\\r\nAs%s+PvP%s+Seasons%s+progress,%s+new%s+gear%s+will%s+become%s+available%s+in%s+this%s+area%.</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\honorvendoralliance:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">拜访荣誉装备商人！</h{{2}}><br/>\\r\n<p>拜访暴风城 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|h暴风城|h|r 旧城区的勇士大厅中的约翰·\"水手\"·霍诺尔。<br/><br/>\\r\n他的位置会在地图上以荣誉与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 军需官的兴趣点标记出来。</p>\\r\n{page}\\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{3}} align=\"center\">荣誉装备会提升你的 PvP 实力！</h{{4}}><br/>\\r\n<p>这名 NPC 用 PvP 装备兑换 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|h荣誉点数|h|r！<br/><br/>\\r\n参与几场战场后，你就可以购买一整套第 {{5}} 赛季装备！这套装备会大幅提升你在战场中的生存能力和伤害。<br/><br/>\\r\n随着 PvP 赛季推进，该区域会提供新的装备。</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlzg:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Reach%s+Item%s+Level%s+(.-)%s+to%s+Prepare%s+to%s+Enter%s+Zul'Gurub%.</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>Completing%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall%s+Board|h|r%s+Daily%s+Quests%s+is%s+a%s+great%s+way%s+to%s+upgrade%s+your%s+gear%s+and%s+increase%s+your%s+average%s+item%s+level!%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|hCall%s+Board%s+Caches|h|r%s+award%s+gear%s+based%s+on%s+your%s+current%s+item%s+level%.%s+You%s+can%s+obtain%s+upgrades%s+up%s+to%s+the%s+currently%s+released%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r%s+Tier%.<br/><br/>\\r\nUsing%s+the%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|hDungeon%s+Finder|h|r%s+to%s+Queue%s+for%s+Normal%s+dungeons,%s+Heroic%s+Dungeons,%s+and%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r%s+is%s+also%s+a%s+quick%s+way%s+to%s+increase%s+your%s+Item%s+Level%s+to%s+(.-)%.</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlzg:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">达到物品等级 {{2}} 以准备进入祖尔格拉布。</h{{3}}><br/>\\r\n<p>完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 每日任务是提升装备和提高平均物品等级的好方法！|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 会根据你当前的物品等级给予装备。你可以获得直到当前已开放的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 阶段的装备提升。<br/><br/>\\r\n使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r 排队进入普通地下城、英雄地下城和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r，也是快速提升物品等级到 {{4}} 的方法。</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\lockingspellsandtalents1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Locks%s+Protect%s+Your%s+Build%s+and%s+Make%s+Rerolling%s+Easier!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>Select%s+the%s+Lock%s+icon%s+on%s+an%s+ability%s+or%s+talent%s+you%s+would%s+like%s+to%s+lock%.%s+These%s+can%s+be%s+unlocked%s+at%s+any%s+time%.<br/><br/>\\r\nLocked%s+Spells%s+and%s+Talents%s+cannot%s+be%s+rerolled%s+until%s+unlocking%s+them%s+by%s+clicking%s+the%s+Lock%s+icon%s+again%.%s+This%s+prevents%s+accidentally%s+rerolling%s+important%s+spells!<br/><br/>\\r\nLocked%s+Spells%s+and%s+Talents%s+sort%s+to%s+the%s+top%.%s+This%s+allows%s+you%s+to%s+quickly%s+find%s+unlocked%s+spells%s+and%s+talents%s+to%s+reroll%s+and%s+ensures%s+you%s+don't%s+reroll%s+ones%s+you%s+want%s+to%s+keep!</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\lockingspellsandtalents1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">锁定可以保护你的构筑并让重抽更轻松！</h{{2}}><br/>\\r\n<p>在你想要锁定的技能或天赋上选择锁定图标。这些锁定随时都可以解除。<br/><br/>\\r\n被锁定的法术和天赋无法被重抽，直到你再次点击锁定图标解除锁定。这可以防止意外重抽重要的法术！<br/><br/>\\r\n被锁定的法术和天赋会排在最上方。这让你能快速找到可重抽的未锁定法术和天赋，并确保你不会重抽想保留的那些！</p>"}
P[#P+1]={"^{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\manastormsprintserum1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h(.-)%s+align=\"center\">Buy%s+the%s+|cffe6cc80|Hitem:339050|h%[Sprint%s+Serum%]|h|r%s+from%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h|r!</h(.-)><br/>\\r\n<p>This%s+movement%s+speed%s+potion%s+is%s+an%s+extremely%s+versatile%s+Active%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r%s+Spell%s+that%s+will%s+help%s+you%s+avoid%s+deadly%s+ground%s+effects,%s+distance%s+yourself%s+from%s+enemies,%s+and%s+close%s+the%s+gap%s+between%s+you%s+and%s+enemies%s+when%s+necessary%.<br/><br/>\\r\nThis%s+must%s+be%s+set%s+as%s+an%s+Active%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r%s+Spell%s+through%s+the%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r%s+UI%s+before%s+it%s+can%s+be%s+used!<br/><br/>\\r\nThe%s+|cffe6cc80|Hitem:339050|h%[Sprint%s+Serum%]|h|r%s+Spell%s+can%s+be%s+found%s+inside%s+the%s+Ascension%s+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r%s+Items%s+tab%s+in%s+your%s+spell%s+book!</p>%s*$","{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\manastormsprintserum1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\r\n<h{{1}} align=\"center\">从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|h考格斯沃斯|h|r 处购买 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:339050|h[疾跑血清]|h|r！</h{{2}}><br/>\\r\n<p>这种移动速度药水是一种极其多用途的主动 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 法术，可以帮助你躲避致命的地面效果、与敌人拉开距离，并在必要时迅速接近敌人。<br/><br/>\\r\n必须先通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 界面将其设为主动 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 法术才能使用！<br/><br/>\\r\n|cffe6cc80|Hitem:339050|h[疾跑血清]|h|r 法术可在法术书中的飞升 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 物品标签页中找到！</p>"}
